h-century textile industry boom to house textile mills, their owners and their workers, and rapidly grew to become an important industrial and commerce centre. Since the end of the Soviet era, the textile industry split into many smaller companies, which often specialize in technically complex products such as lingerie and wedding dresses. The city rebounded in the 21st century due to foreign investment in IT industries.","grounding":[{"source":"wikivoyage","title":"Łódź","url":"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/%C5%81%C3%B3d%C5%BA","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"short":"Lodz is a major art city in Poland, part of the UNESCO Creative Cities Network. The Izrael Poznanski Palace and White Factory lead the sights; seventeen hours would cover them all, best May through September.","short_src":"rewrite","facts":{"population":639890,"visit_h":14}},"highlights":[{"id":"hl-alexander-nevsky-cathedral","name":"Alexander Nevsky Cathedral","kind":"Cathedral","lat":51.77069,"lon":19.46436,"dist_km":0.9,"rank_score":9.28,"resolved_by":"catalogue","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/SM_%C5%81%C3%B3d%C5%BA_Cerkiew_katedralna_%C5%9Bw_Aleksandra_Newskiego_2017_%281%29_ID_613040.jpg/960px-SM_%C5%81%C3%B3d%C5%BA_Cerkiew_katedralna_%C5%9Bw_Aleksandra_Newskiego_2017_%281%29_ID_613040.jpg","author":"Sławomir Milejski","licence":"CC BY 3.0","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:SM_%C5%81%C3%B3d%C5%BA_Cerkiew_katedralna_%C5%9Bw_Aleksandra_Newskiego_2017_(1)_ID_613040.jpg","ok_print":true}},{"id":"hl-archcathedral-basilica-of-st-stanislaus-kostka-lodz","name":"Archcathedral Basilica of St. Stanislaus Kostka, Łódź","kind":"Cathedral","lat":51.74882,"lon":19.45961,"dist_km":3.1,"rank_score":7.61,"resolved_by":"catalogue","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Lodz_katedra_%28dron%29.jpg/960px-Lodz_katedra_%28dron%29.jpg","author":"Kapitel","licence":"CC BY-SA